TY  - JOUR
TI  - A brief, global history of microsimulation models in health: Past applications, lessons learned and future directions
AU  - Schofield, Deborah J
AU  - Zeppel, Melanie JB
AU  - Tan, Owen
AU  - Lymer, Sharyn
AU  - Cunich, Michelle M
AU  - Shrestha, Rupendra N
VL  - 11
IS  - 1
PY  - 2018
DA  - 2018/04/30
